        <mxCell id="flow-legend" value="Flow&#10;1. DNS routes to the active region&#10;2. DNS holds the passive region on standby&#10;3. Primary LB to Zone-1 app&#10;4. Primary LB to Zone-2 app&#10;5. Zone-1 app to Zone-1 writer DB&#10;6. Zone-1 app to Zone-1 cache&#10;7. In-region standby DB replication (Zone-1 to Zone-2)&#10;8. Zone-1 app writes the regional object store&#10;9. Passive LB to Zone-1 app&#10;10. Cross-region DB replication (primary to passive)&#10;11. Cross-region object-store replication (CRR)&#10;12. Regional queue drives the worker (async)&#10;13. Edge WAF policy fronts the CDN&#10;14. CDN access logs to the audit bucket (async)&#10;15. CDN origin fetch to the primary LB&#10;16. Zone-1 app to the Zone-1 API tier&#10;17. API tier emits telemetry to observability (async)&#10;18. Primary worker reads the secrets store&#10;19. Zone-2 app to Zone-2 cache&#10;20. Zone-2 app writes the regional object store&#10;21. Zone-2 app to the Zone-2 API tier" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2720" y="120" width="280" height="468" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend" value="Legend&#10;Solid line = primary flow&#10;Dashed line = asynchronous / event-driven flow&#10;Red = blocked / missing / disabled&#10;🆕 = new in version N&#10;🔄 = changed in version N&#10;Outer boundary = stack Boundary (captioned; provider style)&#10;Inner boundary = Network Boundary (captioned; provider style)&#10;Numbered markers (1..N) = ordered data flow steps; see Flow list&#10;Nesting: boundary > region > network boundary > zone (AZ / AD / zone)&#10;standby (dashed outline, -standby label) = passive peer mirrors the active one; edges omitted for clarity" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10" vertex="1" parent="1">
